  "details": "I've been watching a VRChat streamer trying to figure out how to create a group and struggling a lot to figure it out. They had no VRC+. They went to Groups in-game and there was no create group button. They went to the website and the \"Create Group\" button is just disabled without any other info. Someone has to do a UX run of the group creation flow because it's really confusing to even figure out that you need a VRC+ to do that.",
